{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:LiftingAndDescent.P3BlowupYekutieli","@type":"LeanModule","name":"LiftingAndDescent.P3BlowupYekutieli","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Logic.Basic"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.blowup_yekutieli","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.blowup_yekutieli","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/p3-blowup-yekutieli.lean#L61-L74","doc":"**Blowup as Yekutieli lifting obstruction** ([`prop:blowup-yekutieli`]).\n\nThe two equivalences of the manuscript reformulation:\n\n- smoothness ⟺ all obstruction classes vanish (the definitional input);\n- blowup (non-smoothness) ⟺ existence of a finite obstruction level\n  `n*` with `κ_{n*}(v) ≠ 0` — *derived* from the first by\n  contraposition + `not_forall`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BlowupYekutieli.smooth_iff_all_obstructions_vanish","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BlowupYekutieli.smooth_iff_all_obstructions_vanish","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/p3-blowup-yekutieli.lean#L58-L58","doc":"**Smoothness-as-lifting (definitional input):** `v` is smooth iff\nevery brane-tower obstruction class vanishes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BlowupYekutieli.smooth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BlowupYekutieli.smooth","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/p3-blowup-yekutieli.lean#L55-L55","doc":"Predicate \"`v` is smooth (lifts through the whole brane tower)\". ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BlowupYekutieli.obstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BlowupYekutieli.obstruction","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/p3-blowup-yekutieli.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The brane-tower obstruction class `κ_n(v)` at level `n` (valued in\nthe coefficient group, modelled by a type with a distinguished\nzero). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BlowupYekutieli.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BlowupYekutieli.mk","kind":"ctor","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/p3-blowup-yekutieli.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BlowupYekutieli","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BlowupYekutieli","kind":"class","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/p3-blowup-yekutieli.lean#L41-L59","doc":"Inputs for the blowup-as-lifting-obstruction reformulation.\n\nThe smoothness-as-lifting *definition* is the single genuine input\n(§3b-cond non-degenerate); the blowup characterisation is *derived*.\n\n`B` is the abelian coefficient group `H²(𝒮, 𝓑)` in which the\nobstruction classes live; `obstruction n` is `κ_n(v)` at tower\nlevel `n`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:blowup-yekutieli","label":"prop:blowup-yekutieli","md":"quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/p3-blowup-yekutieli.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}